<header><p class="enc-kicker">Person</p><h1 class="enc-title">Naplanum</h1><p class="enc-meta"><span class="dates">c. 2025 BCE</span></p></header>
<div class="enc-body"><p class="enc-desc">Naplanum was an Amorite chief traditionally counted as the first king of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/larsa">Larsa</a> in southern <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/mesopotamia">Mesopotamia</a>, ruling around 2025 BCE after the decline of the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/third-dynasty-of-ur">Third Dynasty of Ur</a>. Little is known of him beyond the king lists, and he probably held only Larsa and its surroundings. His successors built Larsa into one of the main powers of the Isin-Larsa period.</p><figure class="enc-fig"><img src="/images/encyclopedia/naplanum.jpg" alt="Naplanum" width="320" height="573" fetchpriority="high"><figcaption>Image: Unknown artistUnknown artist · Public domain · <a href="https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Kings_Larsa_Louvre_AO7025.jpg" target="_blank" rel="noopener">Wikimedia Commons</a></figcaption></figure></div>
